The quarry’s richest ore, at least from this first pass, isn’t prime, lion, or current.

It’s this family:

\boxed{
\textbf{obvious / normal / better / similar / relevant / enough / fair / simple}
}

Because each apparently innocent word quietly asks the interpreter to supply an invisible measuring instrument.

Those aren’t merely Open Token Probes.

They’re instrument-discovery probes.

You give the system no ruler—and discover which ruler it reaches for.